  (junction (at 300.99 115.57) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "016bf078-2e7b-516d-bda1-615f4fcc4a98"))
  (junction (at 300.99 120.65) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "e55b0928-f0f2-55bc-b2ca-de887c247b4d"))
  (junction (at 38.1 36.83) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "53c10c18-e6b1-5fa5-b58d-fd45a0df1f38"))
  (junction (at 175.26 260.35) (diameter 0) (color 0 0 0 0) (uuid "7c7e22dc-3d70-5d17-bb56-ab45e4b76527"))
  (text "A 0.5 mm pitch QFN with pads on four sides is not a two layer" (at 17.78 232.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "60f472c1-e750-56f1-8a41-1f902ace408e"))
  (text "board. A real iCE40 design drops each pin into an inner layer;" (at 17.78 236.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5a22af1b-87d1-5f66-a868-b4619acdd01c"))
  (text "this one has no inner layer, so all 48 escape on the top at" (at 17.78 240.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7aa7e1b7-453c-565f-a521-cfca0f3153db"))
  (text "0.2 mm track and 0.2 mm clearance - a fine-line process, and" (at 17.78 244.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4bb8988e-facf-554a-8b86-2343686c30a2"))
  (text "the reason a 7 mm chip needs 25 mm of board around it." (at 17.78 248.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "81f2f18e-00e3-513b-a46a-3fdb15482b6b"))
  (text "C1 10u + C2 100n: the 3.3 V input, at U3." (at 100.0 78.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "abb2e6f7-7a7e-5eb0-b73f-75ffd46bf871"))
  (text "C3/C4: the 1.2 V core rail it makes. C15 sits" (at 100.0 82.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "78cce905-103f-5159-8f51-a5e6734e6a7d"))
  (text "on U1's VCC pins; VCCPLL is filtered from the" (at 100.0 86.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d982b480-571b-537d-b0ef-bc9909517624"))
  (text "core rail through R3, C17 and C5 at the pin -" (at 100.0 90.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "035ea970-ac47-5ac8-b7b3-6f804adcf96d"))
  (text "core switching noise stays out of the PLL." (at 100.0 94.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ffa2cc6c-3f82-5e7b-82a2-0a40fde65ace"))
  (text "C6/C7, C10: one 100n per FPGA I/O-bank" (at 258.0 152.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "47ed6a2b-837f-59a6-8387-ea7703a194dd"))
  (text "supply pin, beside the bank they feed." (at 258.0 156.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5360c21-0073-5a51-80f6-94f19c607829"))
  (text "U2's mode pins are strapped, not driven: 16-bit I2S," (at 296.0 186.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "37f622be-a5a7-5a8f-b05f-26ad8f0b9df6"))
  (text "no de-emphasis, normal filter, un-muted. C11/C16" (at 296.0 190.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ca66013-4d83-59de-8988-3ff5b4c11b91"))
  (text "bypass its supplies; C12-C14 are the charge pump" (at 296.0 194.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "74065557-87f0-597c-86f6-66c51f63352d"))
  (text "and LDO reservoirs the datasheet asks for." (at 296.0 198.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "99fe74f8-4fb0-5f4e-9e5e-8269663e561d"))
  (text "U1 boots from U4 over its own SPI port; J3 is that bus" (at 17.78 258.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa86a853-3774-526b-8f33-dbf59a7d27ea"))
  (text "plus CRESET, so the flash can be written in circuit." (at 17.78 262.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "162393d0-9290-5b97-a186-ebf09a24e8d9"))
  (text "R4 holds the select up while the FPGA configures;" (at 17.78 266.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04d51aab-c2a8-5c23-a484-d8d5922ab2a2"))
  (text "R1/R2 hold CRESET and CDONE up, both open drain." (at 17.78 270.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6f410ccc-9023-5e6f-b0b5-71d5ba664609"))
